WEBVTT

00:04.670 --> 00:05.710
Puru!

00:05.710 --> 00:07.710
The shtupid human is fully healed!

00:08.210 --> 00:11.750
I feel like I've... been here before.

00:12.250 --> 00:13.710
So the lock has been fixed.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.250
It has self-repairing capabilities.

00:16.710 --> 00:19.170
Otherwise, I'd never forgive you.

00:19.790 --> 00:22.580
I didn't have anything to do
the past two days.

00:22.580 --> 00:27.540
I fixed it up and managed to reconnect it
back to the Moon's surface myself.

00:31.630 --> 00:33.040
Chimera.

00:33.040 --> 00:35.290
Long time, no see?

00:35.290 --> 00:37.130
I don't know you.

00:37.130 --> 00:40.380
Sup! Sorry, you can only hear my voice now!

00:40.380 --> 00:42.460
I'm here too though!

00:42.460 --> 00:43.670
Golem?

00:43.960 --> 00:46.210
I don't really like you.

00:46.210 --> 00:48.170
Why're you being so cold out of nowhere?

00:48.170 --> 00:50.080
Shilenshe, you moronsh!

00:50.080 --> 00:50.750
Huh?

00:50.750 --> 00:52.880
We're in the preshenshe of
Mashter Crimshon!

00:53.080 --> 00:55.330
I heard all the details about the battle.

00:55.830 --> 00:57.920
The Silverware Princess died?

00:57.920 --> 00:59.540
That's unfortunate.

00:59.540 --> 01:01.380
About that, Crimson-

01:01.380 --> 01:03.080
But there's nothing we can do about it now.

01:03.080 --> 01:05.580
Let's just be glad you're alive and well.

01:05.580 --> 01:07.710
I won't make you kneel this time.

01:07.710 --> 01:09.920
The rest of you, good work.

01:10.210 --> 01:12.750
The battle of Lese is over now.

01:13.210 --> 01:15.460
We did not win, but we did
reap some benefits.

01:15.880 --> 01:20.880
For the time being, we'll ready a new
fighting force centered around Ragna.

01:20.880 --> 01:23.540
Our next move will be within three years

01:23.540 --> 01:25.920
when the Globe Chamber's
restoration is complete.

01:25.920 --> 01:27.080
Wait.

01:27.330 --> 01:29.040
It's not over yet.

01:29.040 --> 01:30.130
What?

01:30.500 --> 01:32.880
We still haven't hunted Ultimatia.

01:32.880 --> 01:34.630
Of course we'll hunt her.

01:34.630 --> 01:37.500
But right now,
our odds of winning are low.

01:37.500 --> 01:39.040
If you want certain victory,

01:39.040 --> 01:40.880
we need to make preparations and
wait for the time to be right.

01:40.880 --> 01:43.580
I don't want certain victory!

01:43.580 --> 01:44.920
I want to win now!

01:44.920 --> 01:46.290
Will you just lay off wit-

01:46.630 --> 01:49.750
Winning now won't bring back
the Silverware Princess.

01:51.250 --> 01:53.540
But there are others who survived.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.750
Several dozen members of
the Argentum Corps survived.

01:57.250 --> 02:01.330
They might fight alongside you one day.

02:01.330 --> 02:03.580
I'll make them.

02:04.290 --> 02:06.210
They'll get stronger with you,

02:06.210 --> 02:07.630
and you'll avenge the princess
together in a few yea-

02:07.630 --> 02:08.580
Lia isn't dead.
and you'll avenge the princess<b>
</b>together in a few yea-<b></b>

02:08.580 --> 02:09.080
Lia isn't dead.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.130
What?

02:10.670 --> 02:12.460
Lia is still alive!

02:13.330 --> 02:19.330
<b>Episode 19: Reason to Fight</b>

02:13.960 --> 02:15.960
The Silverware Princess is alive?

02:16.580 --> 02:18.380
That can't be.

02:18.380 --> 02:19.920
Her head was cut off.

02:21.750 --> 02:25.080
And when a person's head
gets cut off, they die.

02:25.080 --> 02:27.040
But she's still alive!

02:27.040 --> 02:28.210
I feel it!

02:29.040 --> 02:33.460
At the end of that battle, Lia and I
profoundly connected through our auras.

02:34.330 --> 02:36.830
I still feel that connection.

02:36.830 --> 02:38.580
I feel it even on the Moon!

02:38.580 --> 02:40.710
That's so dubious.

02:40.710 --> 02:42.210
It's not dubious!

02:42.540 --> 02:45.790
I was so upset that I didn't
understand it at the time,

02:45.790 --> 02:48.420
but now that I think about it, it is weird!

02:48.420 --> 02:49.880
When it happened...

02:49.880 --> 02:53.630
Woltekamui immediately put
Lia's head back on her neck.

02:54.210 --> 02:57.000
It stuck right on, just like a magnet!

02:58.500 --> 03:02.000
Why did he take her body anyway?

03:02.920 --> 03:05.500
If he wanted to provoke me,
he only needed the head.

03:05.500 --> 03:08.250
That doesn't prove she survived.

03:08.250 --> 03:10.790
You're clinging to wishful thinkin-

03:10.790 --> 03:12.290
When others start talking,

03:14.080 --> 03:16.830
I have a tendency to let them
monopolize the conversation.

03:16.830 --> 03:19.210
I might not be able to
explain it very well,

03:19.210 --> 03:22.130
but I should have told the corps
from the start!

03:22.500 --> 03:24.290
Lia is alive!

03:24.290 --> 03:26.460
I have to see her again!

03:26.830 --> 03:28.920
The battle isn't over yet!

03:28.920 --> 03:30.710
Help me, Crimson!

03:32.250 --> 03:34.670
I can't act on something so dubious.

03:34.670 --> 03:36.170
It's an absolute certainty to me!

03:36.170 --> 03:38.290
Right now, you can't beat Kamui.

03:39.630 --> 03:43.960
They've got Time Control Magic, Woltekamui,
and preparedness on their side.

03:43.960 --> 03:47.500
Beating Time Control Magic
necessitates the element of surprise.

03:47.500 --> 03:49.460
Currently, we can't do that.

03:49.460 --> 03:51.710
I'll keep Woltekamui in check!

03:51.710 --> 03:54.130
Then you can do something about Ultimatia!

03:54.130 --> 03:56.830
You're the former Winged Monarch!
Surely you can do something!

03:56.830 --> 04:00.130
And I need enough time to
prepare that "something!"

04:00.130 --> 04:01.830
There's no benefit to fighting them now.

04:01.830 --> 04:03.670
Lia is the benefit!

04:03.670 --> 04:05.380
She's an amazing person!

04:05.380 --> 04:07.670
And she'll become even more amazing!

04:07.670 --> 04:10.040
We need her to destroy the dragons!

04:13.630 --> 04:16.000
We don't, as long as we have you.

04:16.000 --> 04:21.130
Earlier, I said I want to create
a combat unit centered around you.

04:21.500 --> 04:24.920
Armed with your silverine, it will be
the ultimate dragon-slaying force.

04:25.250 --> 04:27.170
If the Silverware Princess
were a member of it...

04:27.420 --> 04:30.130
She would certainly be a great asset.

04:30.130 --> 04:32.920
But not so much of one that it
wouldn't be viable without her.

04:33.750 --> 04:38.210
With you, we can strengthen the troops,
and I'll command them.

04:38.210 --> 04:40.210
She is not so desirable of
a resource to risk it

04:40.210 --> 04:41.880
when the odds of winning are so slim.

04:41.880 --> 04:43.290
No.

04:43.290 --> 04:44.580
That's not what I-

04:44.580 --> 04:48.790
You vowed to destroy dragonkind
with me, not her.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.790
I'll use you.

04:53.790 --> 04:55.630
I'll guide you.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.830
That's why you must follow me.

04:58.330 --> 05:00.420
I don't want to lose you here.

05:00.920 --> 05:03.630
What are you... talking about?

05:04.000 --> 05:05.830
I won't die!

05:05.830 --> 05:07.540
After all, I'm-

05:07.540 --> 05:10.420
I'll tell you the reason why
you're not dead yet.

05:11.290 --> 05:13.210
Just pure luck.

05:15.880 --> 05:16.710
Huh?

05:16.710 --> 05:18.290
It's happenstance.

05:18.290 --> 05:21.830
You just happened to be the
only survivor in each of your battles.

05:22.670 --> 05:26.750
The odds of that are very low,
but it is possible.

05:27.290 --> 05:30.290
You're standing atop of miraculous
heap of coincidences

05:30.290 --> 05:32.000
that you stumbled upon by chance.

05:32.290 --> 05:35.210
But your next move might be
when your luck runs out.

05:36.790 --> 05:38.040
Luck?

05:38.500 --> 05:42.040
Everyone in my life died,
and I alone survived,

05:42.040 --> 05:44.880
not because I was cursed, but just from...

05:52.000 --> 05:53.420
That can't be.

05:56.420 --> 06:01.420
But if my luck is gonna run out,
then I won't rely on it anymore.

06:03.420 --> 06:07.420
I'm gonna make sure all of us survive.

06:09.750 --> 06:11.790
Let's have a dragon barbecue!

06:11.790 --> 06:12.790
Yay!

06:12.790 --> 06:13.830
That sounds fun!

06:13.830 --> 06:14.880
Yeah, it does!

06:14.880 --> 06:15.880
Yes.

06:17.420 --> 06:19.290
I finally understand.

06:19.830 --> 06:21.960
Why I want to fight.

06:22.460 --> 06:25.790
Not for revenge,
or because I desire death,

06:25.790 --> 06:28.170
or because I'm afraid of losing things.

06:31.960 --> 06:34.580
It's because I want all of us to survive

06:38.210 --> 06:40.210
and laugh together.

06:45.790 --> 06:48.080
I won't ask you to help anymore.

06:48.710 --> 06:51.080
Open a door to the surface, Crimson!

06:51.580 --> 06:54.500
Do you wanna kill the
surviving corps members?

06:54.500 --> 06:56.960
If you tell them the
Silverware Princess is alive,

06:56.960 --> 07:00.210
the corps will go back to Lese, right?

07:00.210 --> 07:02.670
After all they went through to survive,

07:02.670 --> 07:05.920
you're gonna drag them into a battle
they have no shot of winning?

07:06.250 --> 07:09.420
This time, they'll die. All of them.

07:09.420 --> 07:11.130
That's what you want?

07:12.000 --> 07:13.210
No.

07:13.630 --> 07:15.580
It's so sad, so painful...

07:16.000 --> 07:18.380
This is our battle!

07:18.670 --> 07:21.880
The battle between those of us
who chose to flee and survive

07:21.880 --> 07:25.290
and the dragons who are out to kill us!

07:26.380 --> 07:30.670
But I know for certain it won't be my fault.

07:31.420 --> 07:33.290
Oh, damn it.

07:33.290 --> 07:34.710
I screwed up.

07:35.130 --> 07:39.040
He was just a mediocre, incapable nobody
with power completely out of his depth.

07:39.040 --> 07:40.790
Send me back to the Earth's surface.

07:40.790 --> 07:43.580
But that's no longer the case.

07:50.040 --> 07:51.210
Thank you.

07:55.790 --> 07:57.210
You'll regret this.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.920
You're really gonna regret it!

08:13.710 --> 08:15.330
That's poison.

08:15.330 --> 08:18.330
You'll die in throes of agony
if you drink it.

08:18.750 --> 08:20.250
But don't fret.

08:20.250 --> 08:25.330
This effect will only take place
if you try to rebel against me.

08:28.130 --> 08:29.630
Shtupid human!

08:29.630 --> 08:32.630
I tried to reach him by
pulling on his heartstrings,

08:32.630 --> 08:35.130
but he was too stupid to get it.

08:37.460 --> 08:40.710
An unusable tool must be
broken down and repurposed.

08:40.710 --> 08:43.920
I told him he'd regret it.

08:43.920 --> 08:45.750
What a disappointment.

08:45.750 --> 08:49.420
Um... Master Crimson,
did you seriously kill him off?

08:49.420 --> 08:51.330
You think I'm clowning around?

08:51.330 --> 08:52.960
No, not at all.

08:53.790 --> 08:55.380
Oh well!

08:55.380 --> 08:57.750
After all, it's only his
Silverine Battle Arts that I need.

08:58.040 --> 09:00.420
With his body as a research subject,

09:00.420 --> 09:03.000
I can probably recreate that
in another person!

09:03.380 --> 09:08.250
Because he had some of our blood in him,
I have an idea of what to do.

09:08.250 --> 09:12.250
Maybe I should mess around with his brain
after I'm finished with his dead body,

09:12.250 --> 09:15.080
and revive him as a zombie servant!

09:15.500 --> 09:16.750
Brains...

09:16.750 --> 09:18.040
Yummy...

09:18.040 --> 09:21.750
Fantastic! You guys are getting
another pal soon!

09:26.080 --> 09:27.080
What?

09:27.080 --> 09:30.710
You said I'd die in the throes of agony...

09:31.130 --> 09:33.710
But I guess that was only an empty threat.

09:33.710 --> 09:35.920
I just got a little dizzy.

09:36.580 --> 09:38.380
Why are you alive?

09:38.380 --> 09:40.130
Why?

09:40.130 --> 09:42.420
Because you were bluffing, right?

09:42.420 --> 09:43.630
I'm still kicking...

09:43.630 --> 09:45.290
That's impossible!

09:45.290 --> 09:47.880
Those were AI-powered,
gene-destroying nanomachines!

09:47.880 --> 09:49.750
It has absolutely no magic!

09:49.750 --> 09:52.580
It should've been a surefire way
of killing even you!

09:52.580 --> 09:55.580
Is it because I'm half sword?

09:55.580 --> 09:58.330
Even then, you should
at least be half dead!

09:58.330 --> 10:00.250
Do you not get it?

10:01.170 --> 10:03.500
Master Crimson is stomping mad?

10:04.040 --> 10:05.000
No way.

10:05.000 --> 10:07.830
Is it because you're that dense?

10:08.080 --> 10:11.830
Still, I don't think that's a legit reason
the poison wouldn't work...

10:11.830 --> 10:13.790
I discarded you!

10:13.790 --> 10:16.080
I already made my decision!
How are you alive?

10:16.080 --> 10:18.250
How are you alive, how are you ali-!

10:18.420 --> 10:20.000
Calm down a little.

10:21.290 --> 10:22.540
Master Crimson!

10:24.040 --> 10:26.500
Oh, sorry. I used too much force.

10:26.500 --> 10:29.960
How iz he alibe? How iz he alibe?

10:30.250 --> 10:33.880
I feel bad about breaking my oath,
but if you're trying to kill me,

10:33.880 --> 10:36.670
I have one thing to ask you.

10:36.670 --> 10:39.290
Why don't your words move me?

10:39.540 --> 10:42.170
I had a dream about the day
my future self met you.

10:48.790 --> 10:51.630
I killed you the moment we met.

10:52.170 --> 10:55.420
I've thought something was strange

10:55.420 --> 10:57.670
about it ever since.

10:58.380 --> 11:01.250
Why doesn't your body have a heart?

11:07.380 --> 11:11.330
You said you're the one who's cursed.

11:11.580 --> 11:13.210
Were you just lying?

11:13.880 --> 11:16.080
Where is your heart?

11:18.210 --> 11:21.080
The members of the corps
moved me over and over again

11:21.080 --> 11:23.670
with their words and actions.

11:23.670 --> 11:26.540
It's certainly because each one of them
put their life on the line!

11:26.960 --> 11:29.290
You're the only one not putting
your life on the line.

11:29.290 --> 11:31.580
All you talk about is "next time" this,
"next time" that.

11:31.580 --> 11:33.750
The enemy is feeling the heat too.

11:33.750 --> 11:36.000
Our chances of winning are low,
but they're not zero.

11:36.210 --> 11:38.830
If you can't take on the challenge now,

11:38.830 --> 11:41.500
how will you eradicate all the bloodlines?

11:49.330 --> 11:50.540
Stob it!

11:52.500 --> 11:53.960
Enouff.

11:53.960 --> 11:55.500
Whadeber!

11:55.500 --> 11:57.670
Habe it your way. Bead it!

11:59.500 --> 12:01.040
Just ged lost!

12:20.580 --> 12:22.960
Um, Master Crimson?

12:22.960 --> 12:24.960
What are you going to do now?

12:24.960 --> 12:26.170
Sleep.

12:26.420 --> 12:28.170
Huh?

12:31.290 --> 12:35.920
It's because I want all of us
to survive and laugh together.

12:36.420 --> 12:40.750
I wish thingsh would've
ended up like that.

12:46.670 --> 12:47.790
Reaper!

12:47.790 --> 12:49.210
Took ya long enough!

12:49.210 --> 12:50.920
Where were you?

12:51.420 --> 12:53.830
We're gonna rescue the commander.

12:53.830 --> 12:55.250
You coming too?

12:56.000 --> 12:59.330
As you can see,
my right arm is a prosthetic.

12:59.330 --> 13:03.040
I move it by drawing on the commander's
silverine manipulation power.

13:03.040 --> 13:05.000
It's still moving.

13:05.000 --> 13:06.130
The commander is...

13:06.130 --> 13:07.380
Her Highness is...

13:07.380 --> 13:10.000
Lia is... still alive!

13:10.250 --> 13:11.500
Let's go!

13:19.040 --> 13:22.250
Hey. How long are you gonna
pretend you're sleeping?

13:25.920 --> 13:27.000
Hmph.

13:27.000 --> 13:29.380
You're Woltekamui?

13:29.380 --> 13:31.000
It's unbelievable!

13:31.000 --> 13:33.670
What power! It seems almighty!

13:33.670 --> 13:35.750
Artful violence!

13:35.750 --> 13:38.080
Viciousness and technique coexisting!

13:38.250 --> 13:39.710
He's a monster!

13:39.710 --> 13:41.750
How am I still alive?

13:41.750 --> 13:42.670
Huh?

13:42.670 --> 13:44.330
When you cut someone's head off,

13:44.330 --> 13:46.630
it'll reconnect if you
stick it back on right away.

13:46.630 --> 13:47.630
Obviously.

13:47.630 --> 13:50.580
And don't think you're
out of the woods yet, dummy.

13:50.580 --> 13:53.830
Look. That harpy left his
poison mark on you.

13:53.830 --> 13:56.170
If the Reaper or any of
his pals get near you,

13:56.170 --> 13:59.630
or if you leave the capital,
it'll instantly activate and kill you.

13:59.630 --> 14:01.330
Or so I've heard.

14:01.330 --> 14:02.830
You will die.

14:02.830 --> 14:05.540
Your life has just been prolonged a bit.

14:05.540 --> 14:09.170
That witch invites you to
join the bloodline,

14:09.170 --> 14:11.170
but when that causes
his partner's death,

14:11.170 --> 14:13.630
he starts ranting and raving
about killing you.

14:13.630 --> 14:16.000
It's just so funny, it makes me laugh!

14:17.540 --> 14:21.170
You swine!
So you were already there?

14:21.170 --> 14:23.420
I just couldn't help my curiosity.

14:23.420 --> 14:27.040
I was only planning on doing a quick
check-in and going back straight away.

14:27.040 --> 14:28.790
But then I got caught up in the show!

14:28.790 --> 14:31.790
For nobodies, that was some
good entertainment.

14:35.710 --> 14:36.630
Tch!

14:41.880 --> 14:43.790
He gave me some nasty scars.

14:44.080 --> 14:47.500
But I've already entirely rebuilt
my body loads of times.

14:47.500 --> 14:51.040
He tried to shatter my very being itself.

14:51.040 --> 14:53.170
He's a tenacious bastard.

14:53.830 --> 14:57.790
That's the reason
I'm prolonging your life now.

14:58.210 --> 15:00.630
I want to fight him at his best.

15:01.250 --> 15:06.380
I thought angering him would cause him
to draw out power beyond his limits...

15:06.380 --> 15:08.080
But that failed.

15:08.330 --> 15:12.330
He was stronger when he stopped
Taratectra's self-destruction.

15:12.830 --> 15:17.670
Without you supporting him,
it seems like he can't fight at his best.

15:17.670 --> 15:19.040
Isn't that just great?

15:19.040 --> 15:19.880
Hmph.

15:19.880 --> 15:24.130
But I'll die when he comes here.

15:24.130 --> 15:25.710
Yep, that's right.

15:25.710 --> 15:27.710
So make a sword.

15:28.250 --> 15:31.290
Make a sword for the Reaper and for me!

15:31.290 --> 15:33.960
One that can withstand my claws!

15:33.960 --> 15:35.290
Get to it.

15:35.290 --> 15:38.420
Your deadline is when he
gets to the capital.

15:41.500 --> 15:42.880
God...

15:43.250 --> 15:48.460
I vow to destroy your enemies
and recover your power.

15:49.330 --> 15:52.330
When I do so, please speak to me again...

15:54.290 --> 15:58.670
Would you mind if I ask
what God spoke to you about?

16:00.000 --> 16:01.750
I apologize!

16:02.210 --> 16:04.380
Were you still praying?

16:04.380 --> 16:08.750
N-no. I was not, Elder.

16:08.750 --> 16:10.500
It's just, um...

16:10.830 --> 16:13.630
I'm still getting accustomed
to your appearance.

16:13.630 --> 16:16.130
Ah, I understand.

16:16.130 --> 16:17.710
Please don't mind me.

16:17.710 --> 16:22.710
I'm, er, I am still feeling disoriented too.

16:23.500 --> 16:27.460
Is this really what having
my own arms and legs felt like?

16:27.460 --> 16:31.790
My young flesh has even induced me
to speak like a younger man.

16:31.790 --> 16:33.460
I need to remedy that.

16:34.920 --> 16:37.380
Is the enemy coming?

16:37.710 --> 16:39.710
It's highly likely.

16:40.210 --> 16:42.380
Zora has already discovered

16:42.380 --> 16:45.380
teleportation circles in several
locations in the capital.

16:45.790 --> 16:50.380
They were drawn in the same style
that the corps uses.

16:50.790 --> 16:52.380
How is Zora?

16:52.380 --> 16:54.080
His state is concerning.

16:54.500 --> 16:57.210
I am not certain he will regain his sanity
until after he avenges Taratectra's death.

16:57.210 --> 17:01.290
And perhaps even then, he may not.

17:02.170 --> 17:06.880
I'm drowning in the past,
and my comrade is gone.

17:06.880 --> 17:08.250
Why...

17:08.250 --> 17:12.460
Why did you apologize in your
last moments, my dearest Tara?

17:16.080 --> 17:17.630
The morning sun...

17:17.630 --> 17:19.130
...disappeared?

17:22.790 --> 17:24.210
Nebulim!

17:24.210 --> 17:26.210
Why aren't you responding to
my telepathic communications?

17:26.210 --> 17:27.250
Elder!

17:27.580 --> 17:29.920
The sun has abruptly vanished!

17:29.920 --> 17:33.000
Nothing is turning up in either
my surveillance network or Zora's!

17:33.000 --> 17:34.460
What about you?

17:34.460 --> 17:37.380
Oh! Um, it's fine.

17:37.380 --> 17:39.080
I'm the one who did that.

17:40.290 --> 17:45.250
After all, this space was left behind by
the previous Winged Monarch, right?

17:45.540 --> 17:49.130
It was created through the manipulation
of both time and space.

17:49.670 --> 17:52.880
As my body has developed,
my understanding has increased.

17:52.880 --> 17:55.380
I analyzed this space again to see

17:55.380 --> 17:58.580
if I could create an area of
never-ending night around the capital.

17:58.580 --> 18:00.000
I thought I could manage it.

18:01.710 --> 18:04.170
Oh! But I'm sorry.

18:04.170 --> 18:06.670
I should have gotten permission first, right?

18:06.670 --> 18:09.880
I thought I could manage it,
and I was so consumed by it.

18:09.880 --> 18:13.210
Your talent really does outstrip the others.

18:13.210 --> 18:16.000
Actually, those words aren't
close to being sufficient!

18:16.330 --> 18:18.750
I would even bow down before your genius!

18:18.750 --> 18:22.210
E-er, your compliments are really too much...

18:22.210 --> 18:25.080
No words of praise could ever be enough.

18:25.080 --> 18:26.630
I feel relieved.

18:27.080 --> 18:30.000
I can let you take over without any misgivings.

18:30.380 --> 18:31.790
Elder...

18:32.540 --> 18:35.380
Then you're truly leaving us.

18:40.210 --> 18:44.540
The previous Winged Monarch
was a strong, cold individual.

18:45.290 --> 18:49.540
We all revered the previous monarch
who matured us.

18:49.540 --> 18:53.290
But the monarch never paid us any thought.

18:53.580 --> 18:56.040
Lady Ultimatia is the exact opposite.

18:57.170 --> 19:00.670
She sheds tears for us.

19:01.670 --> 19:05.630
There is no greater bliss
for a person who supports her.

19:06.460 --> 19:09.670
Take care of Lady Ultimatia for me, Nebulim.

19:11.630 --> 19:14.460
You earn life by killing.

19:15.290 --> 19:18.750
My mother was electrocuted to death
as she gave birth to me.

19:19.040 --> 19:22.710
All the people around me
tried to either kill or capture me.

19:23.130 --> 19:24.580
I killed them all.

19:25.040 --> 19:26.460
I killed people.

19:26.460 --> 19:28.000
I killed dragons.

19:28.420 --> 19:31.040
Each time, I got what I needed.

19:31.630 --> 19:34.460
I killed those in great numbers.
I killed those of higher rankings.

19:34.460 --> 19:36.920
I attained power, skill, and weapons.

19:36.920 --> 19:39.710
And then I was complete.

19:40.210 --> 19:42.170
But it's not enough.

19:42.460 --> 19:45.250
I'm fascinated by the Reaper's strength.

19:45.250 --> 19:48.460
A miracle from a man who wasn't
supposed to get that strong.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.540
His strength is different from mine.

19:50.540 --> 19:53.000
When I kill you,

19:53.000 --> 19:56.250
I'll attain power that surpasses
even that of God!

19:58.290 --> 20:00.420
I do not fear death.

20:00.670 --> 20:02.210
I fear...

20:02.210 --> 20:05.420
dying before I can create
what I need to create.

20:05.920 --> 20:08.500
That being the case, I need not fear.

20:08.500 --> 20:10.250
I will keep my promise.

20:10.670 --> 20:11.960
I will forge a sword.

20:12.630 --> 20:15.250
A sword that can withstand
the Lightning Claw.

20:15.630 --> 20:19.380
A sword that will continue to
battle on and support him,

20:19.380 --> 20:21.580
even after I die.

20:30.920 --> 20:32.790
When will it be complete?

20:32.790 --> 20:34.290
Don't rush me.

20:34.290 --> 20:36.130
It'll be done by morning.

20:36.130 --> 20:39.920
We had four all-nighters in a row,
and now you're making us pull another.

20:39.920 --> 20:42.040
This is like a freakin' sweatshop.

20:43.330 --> 20:44.500
Indeed.

20:44.920 --> 20:47.000
This is my fourth consecutive all-nighter too.

20:47.000 --> 20:49.000
Quit bragging about not sleeping!

20:49.420 --> 20:52.750
But what's the lowdown on the
magic circles already at our destination?

20:52.750 --> 20:55.170
Why are they in the capital?

20:56.630 --> 20:59.380
Just hold tight, Princess!

20:59.380 --> 21:02.630
On the commander's orders,
I cast them during the uproar

21:02.630 --> 21:04.460
when the New District was
being developed.

21:05.040 --> 21:08.460
It was a contingency plan in case of
a coup d'état or whatever.

21:09.330 --> 21:13.790
I already drew a small one to check if
it can connect to the ones there.

21:13.790 --> 21:16.790
The problem is getting the magic
needed for the teleportation.

21:17.080 --> 21:20.080
I think we have only one option.

21:20.330 --> 21:22.250
Yes, I don't mind.

21:22.250 --> 21:24.170
We will provide you with magic.

21:24.170 --> 21:25.460
Really?

21:25.460 --> 21:28.130
For something in return, of course.

21:28.130 --> 21:30.960
We'll do it in exchange for the
magic absorption circle's formula,

21:30.960 --> 21:36.330
and a little blood from
Ragna, Fu, and Majorca.

21:37.040 --> 21:38.170
But...

21:38.170 --> 21:40.500
Do you have any chance of being victorious?

21:41.960 --> 21:44.580
Although half of the Blood of the Wing
has been vanquished,

21:44.580 --> 21:46.580
their main fighting force remains.

21:47.130 --> 21:50.500
If this is a suicide attack with
no chance of victory, I will stop you.

21:50.500 --> 21:51.830
Out of kindness.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.500
We do have a chance at victory.

21:53.500 --> 21:55.380
We hunt Ultimatia. That's how.

21:56.080 --> 21:58.960
As long as the monarch dies,
the bloodline will be obliterated.

22:03.580 --> 22:06.080
You hate idleness. This isn't like you.

22:06.080 --> 22:08.500
How long do you intend on sulking?

22:08.920 --> 22:11.710
I don't remember asking for your opinion,

22:11.710 --> 22:12.710
Snake.

22:12.710 --> 22:14.170
My opinion?

22:14.170 --> 22:17.540
On the contrary,
I'm simply stating your opinion.

22:17.540 --> 22:21.000
That mediocre oaf dared lecture me.

22:22.460 --> 22:25.210
Going on about putting lives on the line!

22:25.210 --> 22:26.580
Insolent pup!

22:26.580 --> 22:28.710
If spirit alone was enough to get results,

22:28.710 --> 22:31.210
I wouldn't be starting over again and again!

22:31.540 --> 22:32.790
To change the subject...

22:33.960 --> 22:35.210
Why, you!

22:35.210 --> 22:37.420
Do you remember Borgius?

22:37.830 --> 22:41.040
It seems he has resolved to sacrifice his life.

22:41.420 --> 22:46.080
So you and I will be the last of
the old Winged Bloodline.

22:46.080 --> 22:48.630
I'm just feeling a bit sentimental.

22:49.630 --> 22:51.250
Display on.

22:51.250 --> 22:52.790
Satellite photo.

22:52.790 --> 22:54.170
Celesviera.

22:56.420 --> 22:58.380
The Writhing Shade.

22:58.880 --> 23:01.290
It sucked the blood out of
the citizens of the capital

23:01.290 --> 23:02.920
and recovered its peak strength.

23:03.210 --> 23:05.500
But it'll only last a month or so.

23:06.500 --> 23:09.210
There is no benefit to attacking them now.

23:09.420 --> 23:12.080
So why are they being so hasty?

23:16.000 --> 23:18.170
Can she not control time?

23:21.830 --> 23:25.040
Everyone, stand by
at full combat-readiness.

23:25.040 --> 23:26.040
Huh?

23:26.040 --> 23:27.920
What? We're going?

23:27.920 --> 23:30.380
It's strictly an optimistic conjecture.

23:30.380 --> 23:33.670
But if that conjecture is correct,

23:33.670 --> 23:36.540
using the corps and that idiot as bait,

23:36.540 --> 23:38.960
we'll take down Ultimatia!
